{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relax while opening packs, creating bundles and collecting cards.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435840/extras/3ad074c3e5c0346b03751d3c7a79b1d2.avif?t=1763040341\" width=800 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435840/extras/b0a4a8298b52ced023bb2f9b086f9553.poster.avif?t=1763040341\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435840/extras/b0a4a8298b52ced023bb2f9b086f9553.webm?t=1763040341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435840/extras/b0a4a8298b52ced023bb2f9b086f9553.mp4?t=1763040341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy and open different types of card packs, each containing new cards for you to discover and add to your collection.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435840/extras/005867e46161a7128d2f7763141516cb.avif?t=1763040341\" width=800 height=171 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435840/extras/db52ef4e149dc592d658f35199183360.poster.avif?t=1763040341\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435840/extras/db52ef4e149dc592d658f35199183360.webm?t=1763040341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it